WEBVTT

00:00:01.541 --> 00:00:10.609
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:20.350
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:30.165
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.436 --> 00:00:39.572
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:39.979 --> 00:00:50.116
<i>I look back...
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.124 --> 00:00:57.085
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.296 --> 00:01:00.697
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms.</i>

00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:06.533
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.672 --> 00:01:10.199
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.376 --> 00:01:19.375
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:45.142
Hold on!

00:01:45.378 --> 00:01:48.814
Yajiro? Those shots came
from the castle, didn't they?

00:01:49.082 --> 00:01:53.815
Yeah, I heard that the guy who hurt Koto
ran and took cover in the Castle.

00:02:02.361 --> 00:02:04.056
King Furon...

00:02:04.363 --> 00:02:07.992
The guy who hurt Koto?
It could be the fugitive!

00:02:08.134 --> 00:02:11.433
One way or another, I'm sure it's
got something to do with him!

00:02:11.571 --> 00:02:13.334
That's a problem!

00:02:13.473 --> 00:02:15.441
What if something happens to the king?

00:02:15.441 --> 00:02:18.069
<i>We have to protect the king!
What if something happens to the king?</i>

00:02:19.846 --> 00:02:22.679
You don't stand a chance against him.

00:02:22.815 --> 00:02:24.749
Leave it to her.

00:02:25.318 --> 00:02:26.216
Her?

00:02:26.919 --> 00:02:28.045
Rushuna.

00:02:28.721 --> 00:02:30.211
Rushuna Tendo.

00:02:36.362 --> 00:02:40.059
The woman who can take on
the entire castle.

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:44.128
Who is she...

00:02:46.472 --> 00:02:49.930
<i>Episode 3
Enlightened Evil</i>

00:03:00.453 --> 00:03:01.579
What...

00:03:03.489 --> 00:03:06.356
...is this look in my eyes?

00:03:06.559 --> 00:03:10.256
You must not have that look, Rushuna.

00:03:24.677 --> 00:03:28.010
Would I look at a flower that way?

00:03:28.514 --> 00:03:30.505
I'm sorry.

00:03:30.917 --> 00:03:35.820
Your discipline as a senshi is impressive,
but to progress further, you must...

00:03:36.088 --> 00:03:38.858
...learn the Ultimate Fighting Strategy.

00:03:38.858 --> 00:03:40.018
<i>Yes.
...learn the Ultimate Fighting Strategy.</i>

00:03:40.426 --> 00:03:46.387
Eliminate your enemy's will to fight.
In order to do this, you must smile.

00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:48.199
Smile...

00:03:48.801 --> 00:03:51.895
I don't understand that so well.

00:03:54.106 --> 00:03:58.566
Hold in your heart the feelings of love
you have for these flowers.

00:03:58.711 --> 00:04:02.738
Become intoxicated by
their fragrance, love them...

00:04:03.149 --> 00:04:05.913
...and you will smile, naturally.

00:04:26.305 --> 00:04:29.138
I can't... I can't smile!

00:04:33.479 --> 00:04:34.605
You!

00:04:52.632 --> 00:04:54.099
Your Majesty!

00:04:54.967 --> 00:05:01.338
Impressive. You've realized that
the weapon's source of power is air.

00:05:02.708 --> 00:05:04.073
Hold on!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:09.170
Don't get confused about who you're
fighting. First, you will fight the King.

00:05:10.383 --> 00:05:12.442
My body won't move.

00:05:12.618 --> 00:05:17.453
If you can defeat the King,
I will let you seek your revenge...

00:05:17.623 --> 00:05:20.990
This man possesses a mysterious power.

00:05:21.127 --> 00:05:23.721
Does he control air?

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:27.722
This power is called Enlightened Evil.

00:05:27.867 --> 00:05:29.732
<i>Enlightened Evil</i>

00:05:29.902 --> 00:05:33.360
It is not something
that will be easily defeated.

00:05:33.472 --> 00:05:39.502
It is the kingdom's defense strategy.
The King sacrificed his life for it.

00:05:40.012 --> 00:05:41.673
Defense strategy?

00:05:41.814 --> 00:05:44.749
What have you done to that child?

00:05:44.884 --> 00:05:49.981
It is all for the kingdom!
The King needed awe-inspiring power!

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.487
Power?

00:05:52.792 --> 00:05:57.695
It was when the former king lost
his life in battle.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.400
Father! Father!

00:06:04.737 --> 00:06:07.205
Fulfill my role as king?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.902
What... What am I supposed to do?

00:06:15.481 --> 00:06:18.575
It's fueled by the energy of my growth?

00:06:18.684 --> 00:06:24.816
Yes, in order to draw out the power
of this destructive weapon...

00:06:24.957 --> 00:06:28.586
...we need the energy of a growing child.

00:06:29.662 --> 00:06:33.496
It's for the people and for my kingdom...

00:06:36.369 --> 00:06:40.328
Then I will give myself, happily.

00:06:40.573 --> 00:06:47.035
And so, the fate of this country
was handed to a seven year old king.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:07:00.190
On that day began a battle upon
which his Majesty's life depended.

00:07:00.559 --> 00:07:05.519
It was a good match, and the
Evil became enlightened rapidly.

00:07:05.798 --> 00:07:11.395
Now, this power has come to be
feared by all the nearby kingdoms.

00:07:14.273 --> 00:07:16.070
How could you do that to a child!

00:07:16.142 --> 00:07:18.838
Power is the foundation of a nation!

00:07:19.845 --> 00:07:21.369
Power...

00:07:23.682 --> 00:07:25.741
Power is everything.

00:07:25.851 --> 00:07:30.652
So long as there are people who
believe this, fighting will not cease.

00:07:30.756 --> 00:07:31.780
Yes.

00:07:32.491 --> 00:07:37.986
Rushuna, go on a journey. Go travel
to many countries, in my place...

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:44.399
...and tell as many people
as you can that... this is wrong.

00:07:45.337 --> 00:07:48.204
I cannot leave this place.

00:07:48.374 --> 00:07:51.343
I'm counting on you, Rushuna.

00:07:51.444 --> 00:07:57.246
Even here in Tento, some are coming to
believe that power is everything.

00:07:59.718 --> 00:08:02.084
Who are you?

00:08:02.221 --> 00:08:07.887
Don't worry about me.
Why don't you test yourself?

00:08:08.027 --> 00:08:12.657
See if you can break down the
King's incredible convictions or not.

00:08:14.133 --> 00:08:17.261
Enough talking, Jester!

00:08:18.571 --> 00:08:23.338
I will take care of the intruder.
You stay out of this!

00:08:23.843 --> 00:08:25.834
Get out of here!

00:08:25.945 --> 00:08:27.242
As you wish.

00:08:30.349 --> 00:08:32.783
Wait, listen to me.

00:08:33.185 --> 00:08:36.552
His guards are there,
so he should be okay.

00:08:36.655 --> 00:08:39.783
But if something should
happen to the King...

00:08:39.925 --> 00:08:45.386
Yajiro said he'd go and check.
There's nothing we can do but wait.

00:08:46.131 --> 00:08:48.156
Please let me pass.

00:08:48.267 --> 00:08:49.256
Koto.

00:08:49.368 --> 00:08:52.929
I told her to stay in bed but...

00:08:53.806 --> 00:08:56.741
See, I told you so.

00:08:59.245 --> 00:09:01.577
Furon, Your Majesty.

00:09:04.884 --> 00:09:07.682
I'm sorry. Just don't wake up.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:11.678
She missed all their vitals, impressive.

00:09:13.125 --> 00:09:14.251
Intruder!

00:09:15.728 --> 00:09:18.128
I said not to get up.

00:09:19.365 --> 00:09:20.354
So...

00:09:22.268 --> 00:09:24.361
Please, I want to talk.

00:09:24.537 --> 00:09:29.839
There's nothing to talk about. I can't
let you live. You know my identity.

00:09:32.878 --> 00:09:35.346
What do I have to...

00:09:37.316 --> 00:09:38.647
Let me think.

00:09:45.991 --> 00:09:48.960
Woman, this is the end.

00:10:00.739 --> 00:10:03.037
Stop making fun of me!

00:10:03.309 --> 00:10:05.607
It didn't work!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:19.016
What am I going to do?
I have to break his armor.

00:10:19.191 --> 00:10:21.523
I'll just hit that.

00:10:32.204 --> 00:10:34.331
It got thicker!

00:10:39.278 --> 00:10:42.509
Normal bullets don't work anymore.

00:10:43.182 --> 00:10:45.742
I don't have a choice.

00:10:45.985 --> 00:10:49.819
<i>Special armor piercing bullet</i>

00:10:49.989 --> 00:10:53.220
It's a precious bullet,
but I have to use it.

00:10:55.361 --> 00:10:57.056
Take this!

00:11:01.433 --> 00:11:02.331
Yes!

00:11:06.138 --> 00:11:07.036
No way!

00:11:11.043 --> 00:11:13.341
What's going on?

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:16.074
Rushuna!

00:11:19.351 --> 00:11:20.716
Rushuna!

00:11:21.086 --> 00:11:22.075
Hey!

00:11:22.321 --> 00:11:24.346
Yatchan, stay away!

00:11:29.461 --> 00:11:30.860
Damn it.

00:11:36.468 --> 00:11:40.768
I underestimated him. To think that
he could shoot such a big one.

00:11:44.576 --> 00:11:47.044
Woman, where are you?

00:11:47.179 --> 00:11:52.276
I have no more special bullets.
I think I'm in real trouble.

00:12:10.869 --> 00:12:13.895
It looks like this is it for her.

00:12:14.073 --> 00:12:17.634
A useless gun and
an injured trigger finger.

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:20.404
She's out of options.

00:12:20.746 --> 00:12:23.579
She's nothing but a plaything for Furon.

00:12:23.716 --> 00:12:27.413
I'm grateful for her help
in his development.

00:12:27.686 --> 00:12:30.746
Rushuna! Are you going to kill him?

00:12:30.889 --> 00:12:33.414
No, I just want to talk.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.722
Talk?

00:12:36.595 --> 00:12:42.227
King, do you know what you're doing...

00:12:42.634 --> 00:12:45.102
...with that weapon?

00:12:45.771 --> 00:12:50.003
This power is for killing you beasts!

00:12:50.576 --> 00:12:51.736
Beasts?

00:12:52.344 --> 00:12:57.407
We are surrounded by beasts
who fuel the fires of war.

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:03.752
As king, I need the power to do away
with those who attack us!

00:13:06.125 --> 00:13:10.789
Without power, I can't protect
my country or my people.

00:13:10.996 --> 00:13:13.294
Without power I cannot live.

00:13:13.465 --> 00:13:17.629
A nation cannot thrive
without a powerful king!

00:13:20.539 --> 00:13:22.439
No, that's wrong.

00:13:22.574 --> 00:13:24.303
What's wrong about it?

00:13:25.144 --> 00:13:30.172
If you fight by force,
stronger enemies will appear.

00:13:30.315 --> 00:13:36.618
That is why I acquired the power
of Enlightened Evil.

00:13:36.789 --> 00:13:41.351
It's all for the
survival of this kingdom!

00:13:42.461 --> 00:13:47.421
Your Majesty, your country
isn't that weak.

00:13:47.966 --> 00:13:53.666
It welcomed and embraced a total
stranger like myself with open arms.

00:13:58.076 --> 00:14:00.977
Everyone is so kind.

00:14:01.547 --> 00:14:05.574
Don't assume that everyone is the enemy.

00:14:05.717 --> 00:14:09.653
By welcoming them with love,
you can eliminate their will to fight.

00:14:09.755 --> 00:14:12.121
The Ultimate Battle Strategy.

00:14:12.257 --> 00:14:13.815
That's nonsense!

00:14:13.959 --> 00:14:16.985
You don't have to fight alone.

00:14:17.129 --> 00:14:21.759
Everyone's kindness can
be your strength.

00:14:22.668 --> 00:14:24.636
A person without power is nothing!

00:14:24.636 --> 00:14:25.864
<i>That's not true!
A person without power is nothing!</i>

00:14:25.971 --> 00:14:29.099
Shut up, you don't know anything!

00:14:34.613 --> 00:14:39.209
Is that armor the reason
you cannot understand?

00:14:39.351 --> 00:14:42.980
Is it because your heart
is covered in armor?

00:14:43.622 --> 00:14:46.716
Then I'll remove it for you.

00:14:46.959 --> 00:14:48.221
What?

00:14:53.365 --> 00:14:55.265
How pitiful.

00:14:55.801 --> 00:14:58.133
A last ditch effort...

00:14:58.570 --> 00:15:02.062
Besides, what can one bullet do anyway?

00:15:03.108 --> 00:15:04.598
One bullet...

00:15:07.145 --> 00:15:08.203
What!

00:15:16.054 --> 00:15:17.919
What is this power?

00:15:18.056 --> 00:15:23.688
The bullet hit me square on!
Is that what's amplifying it's power?

00:15:40.913 --> 00:15:41.971
Oh no!

00:15:46.385 --> 00:15:49.218
The castle exploded!

00:15:49.588 --> 00:15:51.351
King Furon!

00:15:51.456 --> 00:15:52.480
Koto!

00:15:59.398 --> 00:16:00.922
Ouch...

00:16:02.601 --> 00:16:05.001
The floor fell through.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.068
Rushuna!

00:16:06.204 --> 00:16:07.262
Yatchan!

00:16:17.349 --> 00:16:18.407
Huh?

00:16:18.684 --> 00:16:19.946
The King?

00:16:20.085 --> 00:16:24.044
<i>The armor came off and
he started to grow?</i>

00:16:24.222 --> 00:16:25.416
Not yet!

00:16:25.691 --> 00:16:28.023
It's not over yet!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:34.622
What do you know what it takes
for a small kingdom to survive?

00:16:35.267 --> 00:16:39.226
You never know when you'll
be attacked! The terror of war!

00:16:39.404 --> 00:16:41.702
The terror of destruction!

00:16:43.442 --> 00:16:45.637
What do you know?

00:16:45.944 --> 00:16:46.933
You!

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:51.577
It's okay to be scared.

00:16:54.052 --> 00:16:55.349
Rushuna.

00:16:56.088 --> 00:17:02.550
The King is human too.
If you're scared, you can ask for help.

00:17:04.096 --> 00:17:05.120
What!

00:17:05.464 --> 00:17:08.365
Everyone loves you.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.492
Everyone will help you.

00:17:12.204 --> 00:17:14.138
They will?

00:17:14.339 --> 00:17:19.504
Yes, everyone always
has you in their hearts.

00:17:25.884 --> 00:17:28.648
They love me...

00:17:32.724 --> 00:17:36.717
They'll help me...

00:17:44.669 --> 00:17:46.136
It's okay.

00:17:46.338 --> 00:17:50.707
You have a lot of people on your side.

00:17:52.244 --> 00:17:54.940
I have allies?

00:17:59.718 --> 00:18:02.744
I have allies!

00:18:06.892 --> 00:18:11.386
That's right...
So why have I done all this?

00:18:16.701 --> 00:18:20.262
Will I be forgiven?

00:18:20.505 --> 00:18:23.133
Yes, it'll be fine.

00:18:23.341 --> 00:18:27.175
So hang in there, Your Majesty...

00:18:27.946 --> 00:18:29.709
We can do it...

00:18:30.215 --> 00:18:32.945
I'll hang in there too!

00:18:47.466 --> 00:18:50.060
She did it!

00:18:51.036 --> 00:18:52.663
King Furon!

00:18:56.842 --> 00:18:59.402
King Furon?

00:19:06.218 --> 00:19:10.848
King Furon, you're okay. I'm so happy...

00:19:21.066 --> 00:19:22.499
I'm sorry.

00:19:46.825 --> 00:19:48.053
Yatchan?

00:19:48.326 --> 00:19:52.285
Is he going to be okay? He doesn't
instill a lot of confidence.

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:55.524
He'll be okay. He has lots of support.

00:19:55.667 --> 00:19:57.635
I bet you're happy.

00:19:57.769 --> 00:20:05.232
I am, but what makes me happiest
is that you came to help me!

00:20:05.443 --> 00:20:07.206
Whatever!

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:11.738
It made me realize I'm not alone.

00:20:11.883 --> 00:20:17.651
I-l-It's partly my fault
that Koto got hurt...

00:20:18.123 --> 00:20:21.524
I couldn't let you take all the blame...

00:20:21.626 --> 00:20:22.820
Thank you.

00:20:22.928 --> 00:20:27.126
Koto's wounds will heal quickly
in the Iwaya's medicated bath.

00:20:28.033 --> 00:20:30.092
Medicated bath...

00:20:32.704 --> 00:20:36.504
You just imagined
Koto naked, didn't you!

00:20:36.641 --> 00:20:38.939
No, I didn't!

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.577
<i>BULL'S-EYE</i>

00:20:40.879 --> 00:20:42.369
I did not!

00:20:42.614 --> 00:20:46.311
I wouldn't do such a thing!

00:20:47.085 --> 00:20:47.983
I see.

00:20:48.153 --> 00:20:53.318
Men need that armor around
their hearts to survive.

00:20:53.892 --> 00:20:58.158
Don't worry, I'll remove
your armor someday too!

00:20:58.830 --> 00:20:59.694
Huh?

00:20:59.931 --> 00:21:05.597
We both must remove the armor around
our hearts or we can't use the strategy.

00:21:05.837 --> 00:21:06.565
Huh?

00:21:06.838 --> 00:21:08.601
Let's go.

00:21:09.874 --> 00:21:12.342
What is she babbling about?

00:21:12.577 --> 00:21:14.738
I'm hungry.

00:21:14.879 --> 00:21:16.779
You just ate.

00:21:16.915 --> 00:21:18.883
But I'm hungry.

00:21:18.984 --> 00:21:20.110
But...

00:21:26.258 --> 00:21:28.522
I have news for you.

00:21:28.693 --> 00:21:30.058
Yes?

00:21:30.362 --> 00:21:36.323
Rushuna and her warrior friend
reined in the King of Tara.

00:21:36.668 --> 00:21:39.660
I see. I'm pleased.

00:21:39.938 --> 00:21:44.932
But I've just made some tea.
I don't want to talk about bloody things.

00:21:45.043 --> 00:21:45.873
Yes.

00:21:49.981 --> 00:21:51.881
Is that okay?

00:21:51.983 --> 00:21:54.008
Yes, I believe so.

00:21:54.319 --> 00:21:56.719
Did you hear that?

00:21:57.055 --> 00:22:01.321
The power that the Jester
nurtured over ten years...

00:22:01.459 --> 00:22:04.019
...it was all put to waste.

00:22:04.429 --> 00:22:07.762
That Rushuna...

00:22:15.807 --> 00:22:25.443
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:26.518 --> 00:22:36.189
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:37.495 --> 00:22:42.728
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:42.901 --> 00:22:46.962
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:48.039 --> 00:22:55.775
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:56.114 --> 00:22:58.207
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:58.483 --> 00:23:03.614
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:03.822 --> 00:23:09.260
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.461 --> 00:23:19.462
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:19.804 --> 00:23:30.612
<i>The winds of tomorrow will
bring the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:30.782 --> 00:23:41.386
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:43.528 --> 00:23:45.496
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:46.331 --> 00:23:49.630
I have a spectacular
street show for you.

00:23:49.734 --> 00:23:53.670
The cost is your smile.
Come all, come see!

00:23:53.772 --> 00:23:59.039
Everyone is welcome.
I'll do it in one shot!

00:23:59.244 --> 00:24:02.771
This is a true one shot deal!
Just kidding.

00:24:02.914 --> 00:24:04.905
I hope no one slips.

00:24:05.049 --> 00:24:09.543
Next episode of "Grenadier",
The Town That Does Not Smile.

00:24:09.821 --> 00:24:12.119
Would you like to join me?
